# PyAMFF 240f51d0 (2026-07-04). One harness call is one evaluation of the squared-error loss and its gradient.
# Stock torch Rprop, learning rate 0.01. Network 10-7 tanh, force coefficient 0, energy coefficient 1, no scaler, one batch.
# Fifty uniform[-1, 1) starts. Stop when every parameter gradient component is below 0.02, or at 10000 epochs.
# mean_force_rmse and median_force_rmse are -1 because the force coefficient is 0.
problem mlopt/emt-pt38
template pyamff/emt-pt38-rprop
cap 10000
counter harness
code PyAMFF
code_version 240f51d0
commit 240f51d01ca22969369f9bc21760c61cbb3b6665
tuning default
algorithm Rprop
n 50
force_calls 91.04
force_calls_min 30
force_calls_max 313
nfailed 0
median 75
mean_epoch 91.04
median_epoch 75
mean_energy_rmse 0.0040654264
median_energy_rmse 0.00404042
mean_force_rmse -1
median_force_rmse -1
par2_mean 91.04
wilson_low 0.928652400867
wilson_high 1
